sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Native hooks
    participant E as Event and state model
    participant P as Audio policy
    participant FX as Effects
    participant V as Voice
    H->>E: Operation A finished, exit status 1
    E->>P: Failure situation for A<br/>Test activity is inferred
    P->>FX: Optional error cue
    Note over P,V: Optional bounded wait for related context
    H->>E: Operation B requested<br/>Explicit retry link to A
    H->>E: Operation B finished, exit status 0
    E->>P: Linked retry succeeded<br/>Recovery evidence retained
    P->>V: Optional grounded summary
    Note over E,V: No task-completion or unobserved assertion claim
